{"id":"tDqYSNiWBMZ6spxC","meta":{"instanceId":"a5925672c1c1d5613a7bfd347269edc98458b5a7e08f0bf7445ee5349c8e0d91"},"name":"Send Jira support auto-replies and CSAT requests via WhatsApp, Gmail and HubSpot","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"1aa65ece-be23-4679-91e1-25ca9975a68d","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-80,-16],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## AI Customer Support – Customer Close-Loop\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow closes the customer support loop across three related paths: it sends an automatic reply when invoked by another workflow, sends a CSAT request when Jira signals an issue is ready, and processes submitted CSAT form responses. It chooses WhatsApp via WAHA or email via Gmail based on the customer channel, then logs outbound messages and status labels back to Jira. It can also create and associate HubSpot notes for both auto-replies and CSAT responses when HubSpot logging is not skipped.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Jira API credentials and confirm the issue, comment, label, and custom-field URLs/IDs used by the code nodes match your Jira instance.\n- Configure Gmail OAuth credentials for the Gmail send nodes if email replies or CSAT requests are enabled.\n- Configure WAHA base URL, session, and authentication details for WhatsApp sending.\n- Configure HubSpot private app access for note creation and association endpoints, and verify the object IDs and association types used by the code nodes.\n- Set and validate the Jira webhook token used by the CSAT webhook path.\n- Update the single line in the \"CSAT Form Path Config\" node after each workflow re-import, as indicated by the node description.\n- Ensure the form trigger is published and that the CSAT links generated by the workflow point to the correct production form path.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the code nodes that load and normalize configuration to change reply templates, CSAT wording, channel rules, Jira labels, HubSpot skip behavior, or the CSAT custom field mapping."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ae5bb432-301a-4e11-99dc-eb9183e1cd64","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[480,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":304,"content":"## Close-loop entry config\n\nReceives executions from a parent workflow and loads the configuration required for the automatic customer reply path."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0a4822ac-40fd-4905-9e97-81b6e9a3c223","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1232,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":560,"height":304,"content":"## Normalize auto-reply payload\n\nStandardizes the incoming close-loop payload and checks whether an automatic reply should be sent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"dbe6e047-bbc5-4173-81f1-e413cfa892c5","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1968,-16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":496,"content":"## Select reply channel\n\nDetermines whether the auto-reply should go through WhatsApp or email, then sends it through WAHA or Gmail."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"fb80aa18-891d-4aaa-a516-02541157d7a8","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2720,16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":560,"height":384,"content":"## Prepare HubSpot logging\n\nDecides whether HubSpot logging should be skipped and prepares the note payload when logging is enabled."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1d7708d2-43f0-4619-982b-d6a33f9f7b06","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3456,16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":944,"height":304,"content":"## Create reply note\n\nCreates the HubSpot note for the auto-reply and prepares or performs the association to the relevant CRM record."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"20353438-aa1e-4fb9-92ca-26720ed31ea7","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3312,352],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":944,"height":272,"content":"## Mark auto-reply sent\n\nAdds a Jira comment and label to record that the automatic reply was sent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"759ac068-2dd5-407f-8bda-88dc7f2453fb","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[480,912],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":304,"content":"## CSAT webhook intake\n\nReceives Jira CSAT webhook calls, validates the webhook token, and applies the CSAT form path configuration."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"900ba571-2e56-44a9-b7eb-a8281811a154","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1232,880],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":384,"height":320,"content":"## Parse CSAT webhook\n\nParses the Jira webhook payload, verifies it is usable, and prepares the request to fetch the completed Jira issue."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0fa7c51a-63c3-49d7-8c49-c563f716c24c","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1648,832],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":480,"content":"## Fetch completed issue\n\nRetrieves the Jira issue that triggered CSAT handling, enriches the data, and checks whether a CSAT request should be sent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"4a4361d4-1768-421d-8094-59d8ba085bb3","name":"Sticky Note10","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2256,896],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":496,"content":"## Deliver CSAT invite\n\nRoutes the CSAT invitation to WhatsApp or Gmail and sends the customer the survey link."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9ca59bb4-56bf-4066-8dd7-a7c8959f9953","name":"Sticky Note11","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2864,1024],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":928,"height":272,"content":"## Mark CSAT sent\n\nRecords the CSAT invitation in Jira by adding a comment and applying the sent label."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0222b1d7-ce6c-4e10-93c6-59aba1b378d3","name":"Sticky Note12","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[480,1616],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":944,"height":304,"content":"## CSAT form intake\n\nAccepts submitted CSAT form responses, normalizes the form data, and prepares to fetch the referenced Jira issue."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e839c9e6-6b20-40f3-869d-f8801d095c81","name":"Sticky Note13","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1600,1616],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":944,"height":304,"content":"## Load submitted issue\n\nFetches and parses the Jira issue associated with the CSAT submission, then prepares the score-saving payload."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e3f14d6a-3ddb-4e46-bdb1-a46777d26018","name":"Sticky Note14","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2720,1536],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":928,"height":464,"content":"## Save CSAT in Jira\n\nWrites the CSAT score to Jira as a comment, optionally updates a configured custom field, decides whether HubSpot logging is needed, and returns the form response on the local path."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"458c3e95-3831-4b24-8708-a2a7b6803f5a","name":"Sticky Note15","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3840,1616],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":928,"height":304,"content":"## Create CSAT note\n\nPrepares and creates a HubSpot note containing the submitted CSAT feedback, then prepares the association payload."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9aa02cbd-72c6-49d5-afc7-5a1eae321ed2","name":"Sticky Note16","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4944,1536],"parameters":{"color":7,"height":368,"content":"## Associate CSAT note\n\nAssociates the created CSAT HubSpot note to the relevant CRM object before the form response is completed."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cf2cdb70-f7b4-45de-8070-10c61bc65eca","name":"Configure CSAT Form Path","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[912,1040],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// >>> UPDATE THIS ONE LINE AFTER EVERY RE-IMPORT <<<\nconst CSAT_FORM_WEBHOOK_PATH = '2b510c06-fa2c-4122-980e-27b92f7c6ab1';\n\nconst incoming = $input.first().json || {};\nreturn [{ json: { ...incoming, csatFormPath: CSAT_FORM_WEBHOOK_PATH } }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"b1cdae01-ee18-47d7-af1c-2775fa5cd9f1","name":"Verify CSAT Webhook","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1376,1040],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"61d1c2f3-6053-4c4d-b544-f955ba4b7fe9","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.canProceed }}"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"b42d4f70-2a58-4b71-8d6f-3626d7ed728e","name":"Enrich CSAT Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2080,1120],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const formPathCfg = $('Configure CSAT Form Path').first().json;\nconst cfg = { ...$('Parse CSAT Webhook Data').first().json.config, csatFormPath: formPathCfg.csatFormPath };\n\nfunction pickJiraField(fields, fieldId) {\n  if (!fieldId || String(fieldId).includes('REPLACE_')) return '';\n  const v = fields[fieldId];\n  if (v == null || v === '') return '';\n  if (typeof v === 'object' && v.value != null) return String(v.value).trim();\n  return String(v).trim();\n}\n\nfunction resolveWhatsAppChatId(phoneFieldValue) {\n  const raw = String(phoneFieldValue || '').trim();\n  if (!raw) return '';\n  if (raw.includes('@')) return raw;\n  const digits = raw.replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  return digits ? `${digits}@c.us` : '';\n}\n\nfunction resolveWahaSession(stampedSession, cfg) {\n  const fromField = String(stampedSession || '').trim();\n  if (/^session_[a-z0-9]+$/i.test(fromField)) return fromField;\n  const fromCfg = String(cfg.wahaSession || '').trim();\n  if (/^session_[a-z0-9]+$/i.test(fromCfg)) return fromCfg;\n  return '';\n}\n\nfunction buildWahaOutbound({ wahaBaseUrl, wahaSession, whatsappChatId, messageText }) {\n  const base = String(wahaBaseUrl || 'https://waha.intuz.net').replace(/\\/$/, '');\n  const session = resolveWahaSession(wahaSession, cfg);\n  const chatId = resolveWhatsAppChatId(whatsappChatId);\n  const text = String(messageText || '').slice(0, 3900);\n  return {\n    wahaBaseUrl: base,\n    wahaSession: session,\n    whatsappChatId: chatId,\n    _wahaSendUrl: `${base}/api/sendText`,\n    _wahaSendBody: { session, chatId, text }\n  };\n}\n\nconst webhook = $('Parse CSAT Webhook Data').first().json || {};\nconst issue = $input.first().json || {};\nconst fields = issue.fields || {};\nconst key = webhook.jiraKey || issue.key || '';\n\nif (!webhook.canProceed) {\n  return [{ json: { ...webhook, canSend: false, skipReason: webhook.skipReason || 'webhook_rejected' } }];\n}\n\nconst cf = cfg.jira?.customFields || {};\nconst labels = Array.isArray(fields.labels) ? fields.labels.map(String) : [];\n\nlet channel = pickJiraField(fields, cf.channel).toLowerCase();\nif (!channel) {\n  const chLabel = labels.find((l) => l.startsWith('channel-'));\n  if (chLabel) channel = chLabel.replace(/^channel-/, '');\n}\n\nconst email = pickJiraField(fields, cf.customerEmail).toLowerCase();\nconst phoneField = pickJiraField(fields, cf.customerPhone);\nconst whatsappChatId = resolveWhatsAppChatId(phoneField);\nconst hubspotContactId = pickJiraField(fields, cf.hubspotContactId) || null;\nconst stampedWahaSession = pickJiraField(fields, cf.wahaSession);\nconst wahaSession = resolveWahaSession(stampedWahaSession, cfg);\nconst wahaBaseUrl = String(cfg.wahaBaseUrl || 'https://waha.intuz.net').replace(/\\/$/, '');\n\nconst formPath = formPathCfg.csatFormPath;\nconst formUrl = `${String(cfg.n8nPublicBaseUrl || '').replace(/\\/$/, '')}/form/${formPath}?ticket=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`;\nconst messageText = `Hello,\\n\\nYour support ticket ${key} has been marked as resolved.\\n\\nHow satisfied were you with our support? Please rate us using this short form (1 = poor, 5 = excellent):\\n${formUrl}\\n\\nThank you for your feedback!`.slice(0, 3900);\n\nlet canSend = false;\nlet skipReason = '';\nif (channel === 'whatsapp') {\n  canSend = !!whatsappChatId && !!wahaSession;\n  if (!canSend) skipReason = 'missing_whatsapp_chat_id_or_waha_session';\n} else if (channel === 'gmail' || channel === 'form' || !channel) {\n  channel = channel || 'form';\n  canSend = !!email;\n  if (!canSend) skipReason = 'missing_email';\n} else {\n  skipReason = 'unknown_channel';\n}\n\nconst wahaOutbound = channel === 'whatsapp'\n  ? buildWahaOutbound({ wahaBaseUrl, wahaSession, whatsappChatId: phoneField, messageText })\n  : {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    event: 'ticket_done',\n    config: cfg,\n    jiraKey: key,\n    channel,\n    email,\n    phone: phoneField.replace(/@.+$/, '').replace(/\\D/g, '') || phoneField,\n    whatsappChatId: wahaOutbound.whatsappChatId || whatsappChatId,\n    wahaSession: wahaOutbound.wahaSession || wahaSession,\n    wahaBaseUrl: wahaOutbound.wahaBaseUrl || wahaBaseUrl,\n    hubspotContactId,\n    messageText,\n    ...wahaOutbound,\n    emailSubject: `[Support-Auto] How did we do? — Ticket ${key}`,\n    formUrl,\n    canSend,\n    skipReason,\n    isDone: webhook.isDone,\n    transitionedToDone: webhook.transitionedToDone,\n    alreadySent: webhook.alreadySent,\n    _contactSource: 'jira_custom_fields',\n    _wahaSessionSource: stampedWahaSession ? 'jira_custom_field' : 'workflow_config'\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"46f2c887-b7e6-473e-863f-e2eac95c14cb","name":"Fetch CSAT Done Issue from Jira","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[1696,960],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json._jiraGetUrl }}","options":{},"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpBasicAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"765fe813-779d-4239-a99b-72d4b764fcc1","name":"Build CSAT Fetch Query","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1472,1040],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json || {};\nconst cfg = d.config || {};\nconst base = String(cfg.jiraBaseUrl || 'https://intuzdev5.atlassian.net').replace(/\\/$/, '');\nconst key = d.jiraKey;\nconst cf = cfg.jira?.customFields || {};\nconst fields = ['summary', 'status', 'labels'];\nfor (const id of [cf.channel, cf.customerEmail, cf.customerPhone, cf.hubspotContactId, cf.wahaSession]) {\n  if (id && !String(id).includes('REPLACE_')) fields.push(id);\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...d,\n    _jiraGetUrl: `${base}/rest/api/3/issue/${key}?fields=${fields.join(',')}`\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"21d96d09-9c70-4572-a343-fe11db0f510a","name":"Capture CSAT Form Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[3136,1744],"webhookId":"csat-form-response","parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"completion","completionTitle":"Thank you","completionMessage":"=Your feedback for ticket {{ $json.jiraKey }} has been recorded. We appreciate your time."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3a17aa93-86f5-4dc6-8645-b92dead87b82","name":"Post CSAT Note Association","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[4992,1744],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v4/associations/notes/contacts/batch/create","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify($json._hsAssocBody) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"53279456-9dbc-49f3-9677-5efbec9dc33f","name":"Prepare HubSpot Association Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4624,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const note = $input.first().json;\nconst prev = $('Check HubSpot CSAT Eligibility').first().json;\nconst noteId = note.id;\nif (!noteId || !prev.hubspotContactId) {\n  return [{ json: { ...prev, hubspotNoteSkipped: true } }];\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...prev,\n    hubspotNoteId: noteId,\n    _hsAssocBody: {\n      inputs: [{\n        from: { id: String(noteId) },\n        to: { id: String(prev.hubspotContactId) },\n        type: 'note_to_contact'\n      }]\n    }\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"eed9309e-b6e6-4aa5-bf0e-33b212cd3ef8","name":"Create CSAT Note on HubSpot","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[4256,1744],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/notes","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify($json._hsNoteBody) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"6da8f789-a6a3-48fb-a534-672b7dc41176","name":"Prepare HubSpot Note Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3888,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nconst contactId = d.hubspotContactId;\nif (!contactId) {\n  return [{ json: { ...d, _hsSkipNote: true } }];\n}\n\nlet body = '';\nif (d.event === 'ticket_created') {\n  body = `Support ticket created: ${d.jiraKey}\\nChannel: ${d.channel}\\nURL: ${d.jiraUrl}\\nCategory: ${d.category || 'N/A'}\\nPriority: ${d.priority || 'N/A'}\\nSummary: ${d.summary || ''}\\nCustomer auto-reply sent.`;\n} else if (d.event === 'csat_submitted') {\n  body = `CSAT received for ${d.jiraKey}: ${d.csatScore}/5\\nComment: ${d.csatComment || '(none)'}`;\n} else {\n  body = `Support update for ${d.jiraKey}`;\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...d,\n    _hsSkipNote: false,\n    _hsNoteBody: {\n      properties: {\n        hs_note_body: body.slice(0, 65000),\n        hs_timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"8f0b0213-dfba-4677-8f69-b81a48ca8f25","name":"Check HubSpot CSAT Eligibility","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[3504,1824],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"e17e6649-f2dd-4cd1-8554-a51c9a938fcd","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.hubspotContactId }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e4e7144c-ff25-4bd2-9132-735e101bdb53","name":"Update Jira CSAT Score","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[3504,1664],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json._jiraIssueUrl }}","method":"PUT","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify($json._jiraFieldsBody) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpBasicAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"ae57fad8-0571-4b20-8355-f549892d957a","name":"Verify CSAT Custom Field","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[3136,1744],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"6dd0885c-9777-4381-81b4-3b67c88825a5","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ !!$json._jiraFieldsBody }}"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"226a213b-7a4a-4437-920f-f2488615e887","name":"Post CSAT Score Comment","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[2768,1744],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json._jiraCommentUrl }}","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify($json._jiraCommentBody) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpBasicAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"58212c10-5e7c-4566-a9c6-e90ab9077b7c","name":"Prepare CSAT for Saving","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2400,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nconst cfg = d.config || {};\nconst base = cfg.jiraBaseUrl || 'https://intuzdev5.atlassian.net';\nconst key = d.jiraKey;\nconst content = [\n  { type: 'paragraph', content: [{ type: 'text', text: `CSAT score: ${d.csatScore}/5` }] }\n];\nif (d.csatComment) {\n  content.push({ type: 'paragraph', content: [{ type: 'text', text: `Comment: ${d.csatComment}` }] });\n}\nconst cf = cfg.jira?.customFields || {};\nconst body = {\n  body: {\n    type: 'doc',\n    version: 1,\n    content\n  }\n};\nconst fields = {};\nif (cf.csatScore && !String(cf.csatScore).includes('REPLACE_')) {\n  fields[cf.csatScore] = String(d.csatScore);\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...d,\n    _jiraCommentBody: body,\n    _jiraFieldsBody: Object.keys(fields).length ? { fields } : null,\n    _jiraCommentUrl: `${String(base).replace(/\\/$/, '')}/rest/api/3/issue/${key}/comment`,\n    _jiraIssueUrl: `${String(base).replace(/\\/$/, '')}/rest/api/3/issue/${key}`\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"bbe1c33c-6de2-49ec-b92e-ac92521c3c64","name":"Extract CSAT Details from Jira","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2016,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Retrieve Jira CSAT Issue').first().json;\nconst issue = $input.first().json || {};\nconst fields = issue.fields || {};\nconst cfg = d.config || {};\nconst cf = cfg.jira?.customFields || {};\n\nfunction pickJiraField(fieldId) {\n  if (!fieldId || String(fieldId).includes('REPLACE_')) return '';\n  const v = fields[fieldId];\n  if (v == null || v === '') return '';\n  if (typeof v === 'object' && v.value != null) return String(v.value).trim();\n  return String(v).trim();\n}\n\nconst hubspotContactId = pickJiraField(cf.hubspotContactId) || null;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...d,\n    hubspotContactId,\n    event: 'csat_submitted'\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"0e69e5c0-9f8d-406a-bd2f-72f79a499fd3","name":"Fetch CSAT Issue from Jira","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[1648,1744],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json._jiraGetUrl }}","options":{},"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpBasicAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"dc856b48-c3d3-4161-8687-abebc5f8437f","name":"Retrieve Jira CSAT Issue","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1280,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nconst cfg = d.config || {};\nconst base = String(cfg.jiraBaseUrl || 'https://intuzdev5.atlassian.net').replace(/\\/$/, '');\nconst key = d.jiraKey;\nconst cf = cfg.jira?.customFields || {};\nconst fields = ['summary', 'labels'];\nfor (const id of [cf.channel, cf.customerEmail, cf.customerPhone, cf.hubspotContactId, cf.csatScore]) {\n  if (id && !String(id).includes('REPLACE_')) fields.push(id);\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...d,\n    _jiraGetUrl: `${base}/rest/api/3/issue/${key}?fields=${fields.join(',')}`\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"53e9d394-ac1d-45f4-b887-de1e935fd4bd","name":"Normalize CSAT Form Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[912,1744],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const CLOSE_LOOP = {\n  \"jiraBaseUrl\": \"https://intuzdev5.atlassian.net\",\n  \"jiraProjectKey\": \"KAN\",\n  \"doneStatusName\": \"Done\",\n  \"n8nPublicBaseUrl\": \"https://n8n.intuz.net\",\n  \"csatFormPath\": \"c8fa2fc7-30cb-4b06-9478-5070d1c488bc\",\n  \"webhookSecret\": \"dhm2p9q4x8vrajw0z3c5b8d2h4j6f1an\",\n  \"wahaBaseUrl\": \"https://waha.intuz.net\",\n  \"wahaSession\": \"session_01hz690b2rb8uqwqr00jyq1dmj\",\n  \"labels\": {\n    \"autoReplySent\": \"auto-reply-sent\",\n    \"csatSent\": \"csat-sent\",\n    \"aiTriage\": \"ai-triage\"\n  },\n  \"jira\": {\n    \"customFields\": {\n      \"channel\": \"customfield_10111\",\n      \"customerEmail\": \"customfield_10178\",\n      \"customerPhone\": \"customfield_10179\",\n      \"hubspotContactId\": \"customfield_10180\",\n      \"csatScore\": \"customfield_10181\",\n      \"wahaSession\": \"customfield_10214\"\n    }\n  }\n};\nconst cfg = CLOSE_LOOP;\nconst j = $input.first().json || {};\nconst q = j.formQueryParameters || {};\nconst ticket = String(\n  j.ticket || j.Ticket || j['Ticket Key'] || q.ticket || q.Ticket || ''\n).trim().toUpperCase();\nconst scoreRaw = j.Score ?? j.score ?? j.Rating ?? '';\nconst score = Number(scoreRaw);\nconst comment = String(j.Comment || j.comment || '').trim();\n\nif (!ticket || !/^KAN-\\d+$/i.test(ticket)) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid ticket key. Please use the ticket reference from your CSAT message.');\n}\nif (!Number.isFinite(score) || score < 1 || score > 5) {\n  throw new Error('Please select a score from 1 to 5.');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    event: 'csat_submitted',\n    config: cfg,\n    jiraKey: ticket,\n    csatScore: score,\n    csatComment: comment\n  }\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"c56d5042-2fb5-4d79-b9d9-eacda9d9af1d","name":"CSAT Form Submission Trigger","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[528,1744],"webhookId":"4eddc59b-111f-4823-8e6a-29a317fab6ee","parameters":{"options":{"buttonLabel":"Submit Feedback","appendAttribution":false},"formTitle":"Support CSAT","formFields":{"values":[{"html":"<p><strong>Ticket</strong> (pre-filled from your link — cannot be changed)</p><p style=\"font-size:1.1em;margin:0;\">Use the link from your CSAT message to submit feedback for the correct ticket.</p>","fieldType":"html","elementName":"ticketInfo"},{"fieldType":"hiddenField"},{"fieldType":"dropdown","fieldLabel":"Score","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"1"},{"option":"2"},{"option":"3"},{"option":"4"},{"option":"5"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"textarea","fieldLabel":"Comment"}]},"responseMode":"lastNode","formDescription":"Please rate your support experience (1 = poor, 5 = excellent)."},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"6ea251af-42bc-449e-8a7d-00bd9cbfb57d","name":"Label Jira Issue CSAT Sent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[3648,1136],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json._jiraIssueUrl }}","method":"PUT","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify($json._jiraLabelBody) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpBasicAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"continueOnFail":true,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"0cbc8461-901d-4d79-aa9a-f03be05913c0","name":"Comment Jira CSAT Sent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"co